    "Limare does not understand these imported fields and has not applied them: %@. Their values are held in secure storage. The connection stays off until they are discarded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Limare 无法理解以下导入字段，因此没有应用它们：%@。它们的值保存在安全存储中。在丢弃这些字段之前，连接会保持关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Limare must stay running for tasks to run on time. Closing the window is fine; after you quit Limare, tasks don't run." : {
