          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The previous conversation's input couldn't be saved as a draft (%@). It is held for now and goes back into the composer when you return to that conversation; deal with it before you quit Limare." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上一个对话的输入内容未能保存为草稿（%@）。内容已暂存，回到那个对话时会放回输入框；退出 Limare 前请先处理。"
